ligned}u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡x & \\,⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x} \\\\ {v}^{′}=4{x}^{5} & \\,⟹\\,v=\\int 4{x}^{5}\\,dx=\\frac{2{x}^{6}}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{3}}4{x}^{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{3}}u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv{|}_{1}^{{e}^{3}}-{\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{3}}v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡x(\\frac{2{x}^{6}}{3}){|}_{1}^{{e}^{3}}-{\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{3}}(\\frac{2{x}^{6}}{3})(\\frac{1}{x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =[\\frac{2({e}^{3})^{6}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({e}^{3})}{3}-\\frac{2(1)^{6}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1)}{3}]-\\frac{2}{3}{\\int }_{1}^{{e}^{3}}{x}^{5}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{2{e}^{18}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({e}^{3})}{3}-\\frac{{x}^{6}}{9}{|}_{1}^{{e}^{3}} \\\\  & =2{e}^{18}-(\\frac{{e}^{18}}{9}-\\frac{1}{9}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}(18{e}^{18}-{e}^{18}+1) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{9}(17{e}^{18}+1).\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330379 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}{e}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330379 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330379 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "30a39296-35ee-53cf-bfb8-6a10b78a1084" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330714 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330714 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186330714 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "54c780ec-8ed0-59df-9662-49d663639bed" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186331815 #edb/ref 1080 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186331815 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186331815 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d22501a3-a221-5893-92d1-782b53f97c93" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332044 #edb/ref 1080 "e\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332044 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186332044 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ee61e062-2a60-54