$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{e}{log}_{4}⁡(x)\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}{\\int }_{1}^{e}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}{\\int }_{1}^{e}u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}[uv{|}_{1}^{e}-{\\int }_{1}^{e}v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}[\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)(x){|}_{1}^{e}-{\\int }_{1}^{e}x(\\frac{1}{x})\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}[e\\operatorname{ln}⁡(e)-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1)-{\\int }_{1}^{e}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}[e-x{|}_{1}^{e}\\,] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}(e-e+1) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424983 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{4e^5+1}{25}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424983 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424983 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1c2596bc-8831-5738-bc87-23664928dc31" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424984 #edb/ref 1080 "2x(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1)+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424984 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424984 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1fac7b1b-401e-571f-9ac1-c8035cba4079" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424985 #edb/ref 1080 "x(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)-1)+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424985 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424985 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "612aede7-2fcb-5f05-9a9e-41d69e0a1e2c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424986 #edb/ref 1080 "x(\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1)+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424986 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424986 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "92b952c7-daa6-5ab4-a7f5-81b3cf909d3a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424987 #edb/ref 1080 "2x(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1)+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186424987 #edb/ref 1082 #